# NOTE: docs/assets/ IS committed — GitHub Pages serves the site from /docs, so the
# headshots and logos must be in the repo or every image 404s on the live site. They are
# byte-identical copies of Output/assets (made by build_web.py sync_assets), so git stores
# them as the same blobs and the duplication costs essentially nothing.

## v12 play-by-play cache (one slim json per game; hundreds of MB, fully regenerable via
